
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SADEEN PS4</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;background:#080b12;color:white;
 font-family:Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center;
}
header{
 padding:18px 10px;color:#e9c45c;
 font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;
 letter-spacing:2px;
}
.banner{
 width:92%;max-width:850px;height:180px;
 object-fit:cover;border-radius:15px;
 border:1px solid #b99542;
 margin:10px auto;
}
h2{color:#e9c45c;font-size:21px}
p{color:#aaa}
.grid{
 display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
 gap:12px;padding:15px;max-width:650px;margin:auto;
}
.tile{
 background:linear-gradient(145deg,#182333,#10141d);
 border:1px solid #b99542;border-radius:13px;
 padding:25px 8px;color:#fff;font-size:18px;
 font-weight:bold;
}
.tile span{display:block;font-size:30px;margin-bottom:10px}
.gold{border-color:#e9c45c;color:#e9c45c}
footer{color:#888;font-size:12px;padding:25px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>👑 SADEEN</header>

<img class="banner" src="sadeen-banner.png" alt="SADEEN">

<h2>SADEEN PS4 HOST</h2>
<p>مرحباً بك في صفحة محلات سدين</p>

<div class="grid">
 <div class="tile gold">
  <span>⚡</span>GoldHEN
  <small>قريباً</small>
 </div>
 <div class="tile">
  <span>🧰</span>Tools
 </div>
 <div class="tile">
  <span>📦</span>Payloads
 </div>
 <div class="tile">
  <span>⚙️</span>Settings
 </div>
</div>

<footer>
SADEEN GAMING STORE<br>
MADABA - JORDAN
</footer>

</body>
</html>
